
### `.gitignore`

Use this:

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# PyDunio generated Arduino builds
build/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# PyCharm
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python test/cache files
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp